WEBVTT

17:03.007 --> 17:04.800
I'm sorry, Bran.

17:04.925 --> 17:05.968
Lord Stark?

17:07.761 --> 17:09.263
There are five pups.

17:10.639 --> 17:12.725
One for each of the Stark children.

17:12.850 --> 17:15.352
- (PUP CRIES)
- The direwolf is the sigil of your house.

17:16.729 --> 17:18.939
They were meant to have them.

17:24.194 --> 17:26.363
You will train them yourselves.

17:26.488 --> 17:28.365
You will feed them yourselves.

17:28.490 --> 17:31.368
And if they die, you will bury them yourselves.
